<title>SPAIN: Madrid shares close at record high.</title>
<headline>Madrid shares close at record high.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Madrid bourse closed at a historic high of 377.52, up 4.83 points or 1.3 percent, officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The rally was fuelled by interest in the electricity sector, a higher dollar and sharp gains on Wall Street.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
